OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fwindy, with further spells of rain
OL,7,Finto the evening. Gradually becoming
OL,8,Fless windy with more lasting clear
OL,9,Fspells later, although still with a
OL,10,Flittle rain and some heavier, more
OL,11,Fshowery bursts possible. Mild, but
OL,12,Ftempered by the wind.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FOn the cloudy side at first
OL,15,Fwith some rain or showers, soon
OL,16,Fclearing to a bright and breezy day
OL,17,Fwith some warm sunny spells and
OL,18,Fisolated showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
